<title>SPAIN: BCH Says sold 3 pct stake in Bouygues.</title>
<headline>BCH Says sold 3 pct stake in Bouygues.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano said on Friday it had sold its three percent stake in French building firm Bouygues.</p>
<p>The deal, which took place at the end of 1996, was worth around 15 billion pesetas, in line with the book value of the stake, a spokesman for the bank said.</p>
